 "title": "El cant dels ocells",
 "description": "The Catalan Christmas carol of the birds who sing to greet the newborn Jesus, for 2 to 4 singers in Catalan. The soprano sings the tune while the alto, tenor and bass hum underneath, on the harmony Lluís Millet wrote for a humming men's choir and printed in 1917. Two verses, unhurried, in F minor.",
 "language": "ca",
 "difficulty": "intermediate",
